+# 0006: Holds are a first-come queue per title with a pickup window
+
+## Context
+
+When every copy of a title is out, members can only keep asking at the desk. The owner
+wants a queue: a returned copy is set aside for the first person in line, who gets a few
+days to collect it. The hold bar (ADR 0003) and no-show fee (ADR 0004) were decided
+earlier. The owner confirmed the rules below.
+
+## Decision
+
+- A hold is on a **title**, not a copy. Each title has one queue, ordered by when the
+  hold was placed.
+- A hold can be placed only when no copy of the title is `AVAILABLE`, the title has at
+  least one circulating (not withdrawn) copy, the member has no active hold on the title
+  and no copy of it on loan, and the balance is below the hold bar (5.00). Refusals raise
+  `HoldNotAllowed`, except the bar, which raises `AccountBlocked`. Children can place
+  holds. There is no per-member cap.
+- Any copy that becomes free (returned, newly added, or released from a cancelled,
+  expired or bypassed ready hold) goes to the first waiting hold, if there is one. It
+  becomes `ON_HOLD_SHELF` and the hold becomes `READY`.
+- **Pickup time**: 7 calendar days from the day the copy is set aside. If that ends on a
+  closed day, it moves to the next open day (`policy.PICKUP_DAYS`, `policy.pickup_by`).
+  The member can collect on the `pickup_by` day itself. The clock starts when the copy is
+  actually set aside, even if the daily job runs late.
+- Only the hold's member can check out a copy on the hold shelf. Normal checkout rules
+  still apply. Checking out any copy of the title fulfils the member's hold, and a copy
+  set aside for them but not taken is released.
+- Cancelling is free, at any active stage.
+- `expire_holds` (daily) expires ready holds past `pickup_by` and charges the no-show fee
+  there (ADR 0004). Waiting holds never expire.
+
+## Consequences
+
+- Renewals must check the queue (ADR 0007): only *waiting* holds block a renewal.
+- Withdrawing the last circulating copy while people wait leaves their holds waiting.
+  Staff cancel them by hand; no automatic re-queue.
+- The no-show fee entry is not linked to a loan (`loan_id` is `None`). Its reason names
+  the hold and the copy.
diff --git a/docs/adr/0007-renewal-eligibility.md b/docs/adr/0007-renewal-eligibility.md
